  "passed_evidence": [
    "The exact dataset, frozen sources, hourly lattice, 2192 complete UTC days and two byte-identical runs passed every integrity gate.",
    "The primary produced strongly positive Normal and Stress returns in both Design and Validation and had no terminal inventory at either boundary.",
